{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandatory custodial sentences for professional HGV drivers who cause road deaths",
        "additional_details": "We feel lorry drivers are given extensive driving training, making any deaths caused unjustifiable, and leaving families with no sense of justice.",
        "background": "We want the Government to introduce mandatory custodial sentences for professional HGV drivers who cause death by careless driving. Many road users are vulnerable to larger vehicles, and HGV drivers received enhanced driver training, which we feel makes any deaths inexcusable.",
